Description: Grace (xmgrace), the Motif 2D plotting tool, built on Qt
 Grace is a WYSIWYG 2D plotting tool: line, scatter and bar plots, curve
 fitting, transforms and publication quality output (PostScript, SVG, PNG
 and more). This package builds its unmodified Motif source, with the
 Xbae matrix widget it bundles, against Motif on Qt: it runs as a Qt
 application without X11 or libXm.
